OL,3,GNEWSAWhy pub crawl route could set
OL,4,Astandards for safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Otley Run in Leeds is no stranger
OL,7,Fto controversy, but now the famous pub
OL,8,Fcrawl could help set the standard for
OL,9,Fsafety in bars across the city.
OL,11,F"We do see quite a lot of sights on a
OL,12,FSaturday," says Max Wilson, a
OL,13,Fsupervisor at The Fenton.
OL,15,FThe bar is the second-to-last stop on
OL,16,Fthe popular pub crawl from Headingley
OL,17,Finto the city centre.
OL,19,FPeople travel from all over the country
OL,20,Fto take part, with many wearing fancy
OL,21,Fdress as they attempt to have a drink
OL,22,Fat each of the 21 stops.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
